Subject: [PATCH] feat: MongoDB-backed scraping job queue with Vercel Cron
 (Step 4)

- Add ScrapingJob model: tracks status, attempts, retryAfter for backoff
- On registration: write a ScrapingJob instead of calling n8n directly
- Add POST /api/business/process-queue: picks up to 3 pending jobs,
  fires them to n8n, handles failures with exponential backoff (30s/2m/10m)
  and marks permanently failed after 3 attempts
- Add Vercel Cron to call /process-queue every minute (vercel.json)
- Increase Vercel function maxDuration to 60s for AI/scraping calls
- Auth: Vercel Cron bearer token OR x-n8n-secret header for manual calls
- Document CRON_SECRET in env.example
